# Private-overlay-backed files: only manage them when the corporate overlay is
# configured (privateRepo set in local chezmoi data). On any other machine, DON'T
# touch these paths — leave whatever exists there alone. The Claude ones carry the
# work LLM-gateway config (base URL, broker, model pins) + its credential helper, so
# they live in the private overlay; a personal machine keeps its own settings.json.
{{ if not (index . "privateRepo") -}}
.config/workmode/pools.toml
.claude/settings.json
.claude/bin/get-gateway-key.sh
{{ end -}}

